cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "Scale_C Benchmarking — Phase 1"
message: "If you use this software or the Phase 1 results, please cite it as below."
type: software
authors:
  - name: "Scale-C benchmarking authors"
repository-code: "https://github.com/foyet/scale-c-benchmarking"
abstract: >-
  Reproducible Phase 1 evaluation of base and cybersecurity fine-tuned language
  models for the Scale-C H5P computer-security education project. Tier 1 MCQ
  accuracy is reported on dual topic-classifier views (NLI and embedding) with
  frozen denominators of 573 and 847 scorable items.
keywords:
  - cybersecurity
  - LLM evaluation
  - educational technology
  - H5P
  - fine-tuning
license: MIT
version: "0.1.0"
